\label{cor:D-L+}
The eigenvalues of the characteristic polynomial of \(L^{+}(D_{n,k})\) (and of \(L(D_{n,k})\)) are:
\begin{enumerate}
\item the roots of \(sU_n(x_L)=U_{n-1}(x_L)\), together with \(\lambda=0\);
\item for \(j=0,\ldots,n-2\), the roots of \(P_{L,j}\), each of multiplicity \(k(k-1)^{n-j-2}(k-2)\);
\item the roots of \(P_{L,n-1}\), each of multiplicity \(k-1\).
\end{enumerate}
If a root from different factors coincides, the total multiplicity is the sum of the corresponding multiplicities.
